00:32:32,587 --> 00:32:36,171
Listening Test

606
00:32:36,171 --> 00:32:40,405
The wind’s a bit chilly, though.

607
00:32:40,405 --> 00:32:46,196
いA + です = be [adjective]
風(かぜ) = wind
冷(つめ)たい (cold [to touch]) ↔ 温(あたた)かい (warm [to touch])

608
00:32:46,220 --> 00:32:49,886
Listening Test

609
00:32:49,886 --> 00:32:54,188
But the sky’s clear—perfect weather!

610
00:32:54,188 --> 00:33:00,089
Vて + います = be doing V
晴(は)れる (clear up) ↔ 曇(くも)る (become cloudy)

611
