Vて + みましょう = let's try doing V
話(はなし)をする = have a talk / talk

617
00:33:25,317 --> 00:33:28,017
Hello!

618
00:33:28,040 --> 00:33:30,118
Hello!

619
00:33:30,141 --> 00:33:33,174
Listening Test

620
00:33:33,174 --> 00:33:36,674
That’s a big load you’ve got there!

621
