I know!

659
00:36:16,445 --> 00:36:21,278
知(し)っています = know

660
00:36:21,301 --> 00:36:24,407
Listening Test

661
00:36:24,407 --> 00:36:28,041
It’s such a beautiful place.

662
00:36:28,041 --> 00:36:33,038
なA + な + N = [adjective] N
所(ところ) = place

663
