681
00:37:45,667 --> 00:37:51,573
なA + です = be [adjective]

682
00:37:51,597 --> 00:37:54,353
Listening Test

683
00:37:54,353 --> 00:37:57,520
But it’s fun!

684
00:37:57,520 --> 00:38:01,895
いA + です = be [adjective]
楽(たの)しい (fun) ↔ つまらない (boring)

685
