That’s interesting!

721
00:40:32,583 --> 00:40:37,560
いA + ですね = it's [adjective], isn't it?
面白い (おもしろい) (interesting / funny) ↔ つまらない (boring)

722
00:40:37,584 --> 00:40:42,217
Listening Test

723
