I introduce various places in Japan online.

724
00:40:47,717 --> 00:40:55,217
N + で = on/via N
場所 (ばしょ) = place

725
00:40:55,240 --> 00:40:58,218
Listening Test

726
00:40:58,218 --> 00:41:01,685
That’s amazing!

727
00:41:01,685 --> 00:41:06,472
いA + ですね = it's [adjective], isn't it?
素晴らしい = wonderful / fantastic

728
00:41:06,495 --> 00:41:10,799
Listening Test

729
